#. Description of the plugin
#: soroban-delivery-dates.php
msgid "Shows an estimated delivery date range on product pages, calculated from your business days, an official holiday calendar (UK bank holidays by division, or Japanese national holidays), your order cut-off time and preparation time. Dates are estimates, never guarantees."
msgstr ""

